items.current:
The Svelte adapter ships as a subpath entry point and pulls in an optional peer dependency — install it only if you use it.

[table] Import / What you get / Peer dependency
@mzebley/canvas-watch — Framework-agnostic core (createCanvasWatcher) — none
@mzebley/canvas-watch/svelte — watchBgCanvas action and reactive canvasWatch state — svelte >= 5.7

